      "citation": "Yu, Y., Safari, A., Niu, X., Drinkwater, B., & Horoshenkov, K. V. (2021). Acoustic and ultrasonic techniques for defect detection and condition monitoring in water and sewerage pipes: A review. Applied Acoustics, 183, 108282. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apacoust.2021.108282",
      "intro": "A definitive review synthesizing acoustic reflectometry, ultrasonic guided waves, and resonance methods for non-destructive evaluation (NDE) of pipelines.",
      "methods": "Systematically analyzed acoustic wave propagation physics in cylindrical conduits, comparing bulk wave, guided wave, and resonance techniques across metallic, concrete, and PVC pipes.",
