      "citation": "Moradi, S., Zayed, T., & Golkhoo, F. (2019). Review on Computer Aided Sewer Pipeline Defect Detection and Condition Assessment. Infrastructures, 4(1), 10. https://doi.org/10.3390/infrastructures4010010",
      "intro": "A systematic review of automated Closed-Circuit Television (CCTV) inspection, computer vision algorithms, and AI defect classification for sewer pipe inspection.",
      "methods": "Compared image processing, feature extraction, convolutional neural networks (CNNs), and robotic crawler platforms for identifying cracks, root intrusions, FOG deposits, and pipe collapses.",
