      "citation": "Li, T., Winnel, M., Lin, H., et al. (2017). A reliable sewage quality abnormal event monitoring system. Water Research, 121, 248–257. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.watres.2017.05.040",
      "intro": "Li et al. develop an online multi-parameter sensor station and event-detection algorithm for tracking toxic industrial chemical dumping in municipal sewers.",
      "methods": "Deployed an automated online multi-sensor platform measuring pH, ORP, electrical conductivity, and turbidity coupled with principal component analysis (PCA) and support vector machines (SVM).",
      "scope": "Industrial catchment gravity sewers, illicit acidic/alkaline chemical dumping, WWTP protection, and real-time anomaly alarm classification.",
