      "filterCategory": "Water Quality",
      "citation": "Corominas, L., et al. (2024). Profiling wastewater characteristics in intra-urban catchments using online monitoring stations. Water Science and Technology, 89(6), 1412–1426. https://doi.org/10.2166/wst.2024.069",
      "intro": "This empirical study investigates high-frequency online water quality monitoring across intra-urban sewer catchments to profile dynamic wastewater pollutant loads.",
      "methods": "Operated multiple continuous monitoring stations equipped with in-situ spectrophotometers, pH/ORP probes, and conductivity sensors across distinct urban catchment typologies (residential, commercial, industrial).",
      "scope": "Intra-urban sewer trunks, dynamic diurnal hydrographs, sewer catchment typology characterization, and redox potential (ORP) tracking.",
