      "filterCategory": "Water Quality",
      "citation": "Carstea, E. M., Bridgeman, J., Baker, A., & Reynolds, D. M. (2016). Fluorescence spectroscopy for wastewater monitoring: A review. Water Research, 95, 205–219. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.watres.2016.03.021",
      "intro": "This review evaluates the application of 2D excitation-emission matrix (EEM) fluorescence spectroscopy for real-time organic characterization and biological oxygen demand (BOD5) monitoring in wastewater.",
